{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8244686",
      "title": "Migrating the Entire Demo Project to use the Context API",
      "sourceHash": "da3ab720ab97772838810e9b7af88fcd9aee1acd76d9923b5e26325ed4512abb",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.14,
          "end": 4.5,
          "en": "So to fully migrate to context here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 7.86,
          "en": "I'll start by removing this onAddToCart prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.86,
          "end": 10.11,
          "en": "on the product component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.11,
          "end": 12.3,
          "en": "because I already removed it inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.3,
          "end": 14.22,
          "en": "of the product component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.22,
          "end": 16.353,
          "en": "There I'm not expecting it anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.37,
          "end": 21.27,
          "en": "I'll all the remove these two props on the header component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.27,
          "end": 24.13,
          "en": "because I plan on using context for that as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.99,
          "end": 27.27,
          "en": "so that the header component itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.27,
          "end": 29.553,
          "en": "does not take any props anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.17,
          "end": 33.3,
          "en": "Now, with that done, we can then go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.3,
          "end": 36.48,
          "en": "to the header component, for example, and in there we'll see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.48,
          "end": 40.293,
          "en": "that it does actually need some data from the cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.25,
          "end": 44.7,
          "en": "It needs the quantity of all the items in the cart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.7,
          "end": 47.823,
          "en": "so it needs the length of the cartItems array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.32,
          "end": 52.83,
          "en": "And previously that, of course, was extracted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.83,
          "end": 55.5,
          "en": "from that incoming cart prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.5,
          "end": 58.2,
          "en": "But now that I removed all those props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.2,
          "end": 60.43,
          "en": "we have to find a different solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.77,
          "end": 64.834,
          "en": "and we can import CartContext",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.834,
          "end": 69.834,
          "en": "from going up a level, store/shopping-cart-context.jsx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.298,
          "end": 77.723,
          "en": "and also import the useContext hook, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 77.723,
          "end": 80.635,
          "en": "so that in the header component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.635,
          "end": 83.767,
          "en": "we can reach out to our CartContext.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.767,
          "end": 85.964,
          "en": "And then from there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.964,
          "end": 89.735,
          "en": "get this items array with the structuring,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.735,
          "end": 93.318,
          "en": "so that we have our items length here still",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 94.311,
          "end": 99.311,
          "en": "but we no longer wanna pass on this updating function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 99.56700000000001,
          "end": 102.05199999999999,
          "en": "and also not the cartItems",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 102.05199999999999,
          "end": 105.65100000000001,
          "en": "because those values can now be retrieved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 105.65100000000001,
          "end": 108.333,
          "en": "by the CartModal component itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 108.333,
          "end": 110.5,
          "en": "from inside that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 111.553,
          "end": 114.196,
          "en": "so that we end up with leaner code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 114.196,
          "end": 116.196,
          "en": "in the header component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117.821,
          "end": 119.95400000000001,
          "en": "In the CartModal component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.95400000000001,
          "end": 124.722,
          "en": "we therefore now also wanna reach out to our context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 124.722,
          "end": 127.722,
          "en": "In here, we wanna import CartContext",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 130.483,
          "end": 135.483,
          "en": "from going up one level, store/shopping-cart-context.jsx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 136.98,
          "end": 141.98,
          "en": "and then import useContext here from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 142.05,
          "end": 144.45,
          "en": "And just as before, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 144.45,
          "end": 149.45,
          "en": "use this useContext hook in this CartModal component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 149.67000000000002,
          "end": 153.59,
          "en": "and pass CartContext as a value to useContext.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 154.62,
          "end": 157.41,
          "en": "And then here I need two things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 157.41,
          "end": 161.313,
          "en": "I need the items and I need this updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 162.66,
          "end": 166.11,
          "en": "And at the moment, this function to update the quantities",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 166.11,
          "end": 170.4,
          "en": "of items isn't exposed to my context yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 170.4,
          "end": 172.953,
          "en": "It's not available through the context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 174.87,
          "end": 178.38,
          "en": "Therefore, we must update this context value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 178.38,
          "end": 181.473,
          "en": "and add a new property to this object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 182.43,
          "end": 186.66,
          "en": "The updateItemQuantity function, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 186.66,
          "end": 188.783,
          "en": "which points at handleUpdateCartItemQuantity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 193.02,
          "end": 198.02,
          "en": "I will also add it to my default value here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 198.21,
          "end": 200.1,
          "en": "where we create the context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 200.1,
          "end": 202.083,
          "en": "to get this better auto completion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 204.54,
          "end": 207.78,
          "en": "Now with that, we can go back to the CartModal component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 207.78,
          "end": 211.863,
          "en": "and also extract the updateItemQuantity function there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 212.94,
          "end": 217.44299999999998,
          "en": "But wait a second, do we actually need those values here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 218.61,
          "end": 223.11,
          "en": "Well, if we take a look at our code here, the answer is no",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 223.11,
          "end": 225.54,
          "en": "because this modal component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 225.54,
          "end": 229.8,
          "en": "actually does just wrap this cart component in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 229.8,
          "end": 233.253,
          "en": "It does not need any cart information itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 234.66,
          "end": 238.07999999999998,
          "en": "So what we should do is we should get rid of those props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 238.07999999999998,
          "end": 243.08,
          "en": "on the cart component now and get rid of those props here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 244.17,
          "end": 247.74,
          "en": "on the CartModal component, the cartItems prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 247.74,
          "end": 250.773,
          "en": "and the onUpdateCartItemQuantity prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 252.27,
          "end": 254.82,
          "en": "And we can get rid of the context here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 254.82,
          "end": 258.12,
          "en": "because we don't actually need it in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 258.12,
          "end": 260.67,
          "en": "And therefore, we can also get rid of these imports",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 261.96,
          "end": 264.93,
          "en": "because that's the advantage of using context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 264.93,
          "end": 268.71,
          "en": "You can use it in exactly the place where you need it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 268.71,
          "end": 271.473,
          "en": "and you don't need to use it anywhere else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 272.58,
          "end": 275.13,
          "en": "So it's now in the Cart.jsx component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 275.13,
          "end": 277.77,
          "en": "where I'm already using this context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 277.77,
          "end": 280.38,
          "en": "where we can now get rid of this prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 280.38,
          "end": 284.55,
          "en": "because we're not getting a value for this prop any longer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 284.55,
          "end": 287.58,
          "en": "And where we should now instead extract",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 287.58,
          "end": 290.01,
          "en": "this updateItemQuantity function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 290.01,
          "end": 294.39,
          "en": "from our context so that in this cart component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 294.39,
          "end": 298.59000000000003,
          "en": "we can call this updateItemQuantity function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 298.59000000000003,
          "end": 300.93,
          "en": "and here on those two buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 300.93,
          "end": 304.557,
          "en": "which can be clicked to edit the quantity of the cartItems.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 306.99,
          "end": 310.14,
          "en": "And with that, we're now not getting any props here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 310.14,
          "end": 312.06,
          "en": "in the cart component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 312.06,
          "end": 313.8,
          "en": "In the CartModal component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 313.8,
          "end": 317.46,
          "en": "we're also not getting any cart-related props anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 317.46,
          "end": 319.563,
          "en": "and we're not setting any props here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 320.7,
          "end": 322.56,
          "en": "In the header component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 322.56,
          "end": 327.56,
          "en": "we are using the cart, but we now are not passing any props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 327.6,
          "end": 329.823,
          "en": "with cart data to CartModal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 330.66,
          "end": 332.01,
          "en": "And in the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 332.01,
          "end": 334.77,
          "en": "we therefore also pass nothing to header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 334.77,
          "end": 339.77,
          "en": "nothing to product, or nothing cart-related to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 340.65,
          "end": 342.48,
          "en": "And in the Product component, we therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 342.48,
          "end": 346.40999999999997,
          "en": "also don't accept any cart-related props anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 346.40999999999997,
          "end": 348.36,
          "en": "because we're using context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 348.36,
          "end": 350.76,
          "en": "in all those components to get hold",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 350.76,
          "end": 355.203,
          "en": "of those values and to manipulate those context values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 357.27,
          "end": 359.88,
          "en": "And with that, if you save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 359.88,
          "end": 363.18,
          "en": "this app still works as it did before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 363.18,
          "end": 364.68,
          "en": "You can still add items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 364.68,
          "end": 368.25,
          "en": "to the cart and update the cart from inside it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 368.25,
          "end": 372.18,
          "en": "And this all works, but it's now all powered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 372.18,
          "end": 375.39,
          "en": "by this context feature, which as you see here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 375.39,
          "end": 378.543,
          "en": "did allow us to get rid of prop drilling.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}